WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.262 --> 00:00:01.780
(calming orchestral music)
- These days,

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:04.370
rose water is something of a beauty trend,

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.390
but it's been in use for centuries.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:08.796
It's thought to have
originated in what is now Iran,

00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:11.685
and it's a cultural
staple there to this day.

00:00:11.685 --> 00:00:14.970
(calming orchestral music)

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:19.181
This Great Big Story
is inspired by Genesis.

00:00:19.181 --> 00:00:21.764
(bright music)

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.210
For the world's best rose water,

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.090
you have to go to the
Qamsar district in Iran.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.750
There, you will find Mohsen,

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.653
who comes from a long
line of rosewater makers.

00:00:37.653 --> 00:00:41.570
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:53.077 --> 00:00:55.050
- [Announcer] And there's
a reason Mohsen's family

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.626
has been making rose
water here for centuries.

00:00:57.626 --> 00:01:01.543
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.470
- [Announcer] Those special
conditions, like the soil,

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:11.477
temperature, sea level, and gentle winds,

00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:14.861
makes the Qamsar district
ideal for growing roses.

00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:16.986
A lot of roses.

00:01:16.986 --> 00:01:20.903
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:30.754 --> 00:01:34.337
(calming orchestral music)

00:01:37.898 --> 00:01:40.176
(footsteps echoing)

00:01:40.176 --> 00:01:42.846
(petals ruffling)

00:01:42.846 --> 00:01:45.190
(quirky music)
(water rushing)

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:46.730
- [Announcer] The flowers
are boiled with water

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:50.395
in large copper pots, where
condensation is collected.

00:01:50.395 --> 00:01:54.312
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:39.585 --> 00:02:41.895
(quirky music)
- Unfortunately,

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:44.960
times are changing for
the rose water industry.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.591
There aren't as many family
farms as there once was,

00:02:47.591 --> 00:02:50.740
but for some, like Mohsen and his family,

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.375
making rose water is
more than a a business.

00:02:53.375 --> 00:02:57.292
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:19.273 --> 00:03:22.940
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:03:24.577 --> 00:03:27.160
(bright music)

